---
// OriginSection.astro: Astronomy inspiration and brand story
---

<section class="section origin-section" id="origin">
  <div class="wrap origin-grid">
    <!-- Left: Artwork vector -->
    <div class="origin-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 320" fill="none" class="origin-svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- Tilted orbital rings -->
        <ellipse cx="160" cy="160" rx="110" ry="46" transform="rotate(-36 160 160)" stroke="#d6b881" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.65"/>
        <ellipse cx="160" cy="160" rx="130" ry="56" transform="rotate(-36 160 160)" stroke="#91b9d5" stroke-width="0.6" stroke-dasharray="3 6" opacity="0.4"/>
        
        <!-- Four-pointed star core -->
        <path d="M160 95 C165 142 178 155 225 160 C178 165 165 178 160 225 C155 178 142 165 95 160 C142 155 155 142 160 95 Z" fill="#d6b881" opacity="0.95"/>
        <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff"/>
        
        <!-- Companion star dot -->
        <circle cx="250" cy="100" r="2.2" fill="#d6b881"/>
        
        <!-- Undulating UV tail wave beneath -->
        <path d="M90 240 C110 225, 130 255, 150 240 C170 225, 190 255, 210 240 C225 230, 235 245, 245 235" stroke="#91b9d5" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" opacity="0.75"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="art-caption">O CETI · AN ARTISTIC INTERPRETATION</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Poetic & Rigorous Brand Story -->
    <div class="origin-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="index">03</span>
        <span>A NOTE ON OUR NAME</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="origin-title">
        A wonderful star.<br>
        <em>A lasting curiosity.</em>
      </h2>

      <div class="origin-cn">星芒会变，求索不息。</div>

      <p>
        <strong>Astr</strong>，遥远星空；<strong>Mira</strong>，真实的变星；<strong>Mirage</strong>，尚待抵达的想象。我们把这层诗意称作「幻梦星芒」。
      </p>

      <p>
        NASA APOD 在 2007 年 8 月记录：蒭藁增二（Mira / Omicron Ceti）不仅亮度在约 11 个月里显著脉动，更在深空中拖曳着长达近 <strong>13 光年</strong> 的紫外星尾。
      </p>

      <p>
        我们借它讲述一种研究态度：对未知保有敬畏与想象，让探索在真实世界中留下可以继续生长的痕迹。
      </p>

      <a href="https://apod.nasa.gov/apod/ap070817.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="source-link">
        名称灵感 · NASA APOD / The Tail of a Wonderful Star <span class="arrow">&nearr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .origin-section {
    padding-block: 110px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .origin-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  .origin-art {
    min-height: 320px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-right: 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .origin-svg {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .art-caption {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-top: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .origin-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 3.8vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 16px 0 20px;
  }

  .origin-title em {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .origin-cn {
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .origin-copy p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 2.1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .source-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-top: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    transition: color 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
  }

  .source-link:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .origin-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
    }
    .origin-art {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-right: 0;
      padding-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
